WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.041 --> 00:00:00.709
CNN senior

00:00:00.709 --> 00:00:02.085
national security correspondent

00:00:02.085 --> 00:00:03.628
Alex Marquardt is back with us.

00:00:03.628 --> 00:00:04.212
Alex,

00:00:04.212 --> 00:00:04.879
we're hearing words

00:00:04.879 --> 00:00:06.840
like nullified, humiliated.

00:00:06.840 --> 00:00:07.424
These are words

00:00:07.424 --> 00:00:09.884
that Vladimir Putin does not like.

00:00:09.884 --> 00:00:10.385
What are some of

00:00:10.385 --> 00:00:11.428
the diplomatic challenges

00:00:11.428 --> 00:00:13.179
of dealing with a politically wounded

00:00:13.179 --> 00:00:14.139
Vladimir Putin?

00:00:14.139 --> 00:00:15.640
Huge diplomatic challenges, Jim.

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:16.808
Huge security challenges.

00:00:16.808 --> 00:00:17.767
Remember, this is a man

00:00:17.767 --> 00:00:18.852
who's in charge of the world's

00:00:18.852 --> 00:00:21.187
biggest nuclear arsenal.

00:00:21.604 --> 00:00:23.565
Any Putin watcher will tell you

00:00:23.565 --> 00:00:25.275
that if Putin is backed into a corner,

00:00:25.275 --> 00:00:27.277
that makes for a very dangerous Putin.

00:00:27.277 --> 00:00:28.903
We have never seen

00:00:28.903 --> 00:00:30.447
a challenge to his authority like this.

00:00:30.447 --> 00:00:31.573
As you mentioned, these

00:00:31.573 --> 00:00:32.991
these vagrant troops

00:00:32.991 --> 00:00:35.076
getting within 125 miles, 200

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.454
kilometers of the Kremlin.

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:40.206
His weakness has been exposed.

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.624
And so he is going to have

00:00:41.624 --> 00:00:43.626
to reassert himself

00:00:43.626 --> 00:00:44.085
in a way

00:00:44.085 --> 00:00:44.919
that demonstrates

00:00:44.919 --> 00:00:45.795
to the world

00:00:45.795 --> 00:00:47.839
and demonstrates to his country

00:00:47.839 --> 00:00:50.050
that he is fully in power.

00:00:50.508 --> 00:00:51.885
The US is going to have

00:00:51.885 --> 00:00:53.762
to navigate this carefully,

00:00:53.762 --> 00:00:54.554
and we're already starting

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:55.805
to see that outlet.

00:00:55.805 --> 00:00:57.599
Touched on the fact that the U.S.

00:00:57.599 --> 00:00:59.768
has had a very hands off approach

00:00:59.768 --> 00:01:01.186
making clear,

00:01:01.186 --> 00:01:02.562
trying to make clear to the world

00:01:02.562 --> 00:01:03.354
that they really didn't

00:01:03.354 --> 00:01:04.898
have any role in this,

00:01:04.898 --> 00:01:06.399
that they certainly are not supporting.

00:01:06.399 --> 00:01:09.277
Prigozhin on his march to Moscow

00:01:09.402 --> 00:01:10.987
But Jim, at the same time,

00:01:10.987 --> 00:01:12.614
obviously watching this very carefully

00:01:12.614 --> 00:01:13.615
and we are told

00:01:13.615 --> 00:01:14.616
that the intelligence community

00:01:14.616 --> 00:01:15.825
did see this coming,

00:01:15.825 --> 00:01:18.244
that in the past few days and weeks

00:01:18.244 --> 00:01:19.746
they have really seen planning for this.

00:01:19.746 --> 00:01:21.331
They've seen Wagner troops

00:01:21.331 --> 00:01:22.999
getting into position,

00:01:22.999 --> 00:01:26.044
equipment and weaponry on the move.

00:01:26.086 --> 00:01:27.003
There was a briefing,

00:01:27.003 --> 00:01:28.088
we're told,

00:01:28.088 --> 00:01:29.214
midweek

00:01:29.214 --> 00:01:30.799
by intelligence officials

00:01:30.799 --> 00:01:33.051
to the Gang of Eight in Congress,

00:01:33.051 --> 00:01:35.136
which includes the heads of the House

00:01:35.136 --> 00:01:37.305
and Senate Intelligence Committees,

00:01:37.305 --> 00:01:38.348
essentially telling them

00:01:38.348 --> 00:01:39.224
that this was imminent.

00:01:39.224 --> 00:01:40.100
Let's take a listen to Mike

00:01:40.100 --> 00:01:41.434
Rogers, the head of the House

00:01:41.434 --> 00:01:42.227
Intelligence Committee.

00:01:44.312 --> 00:01:45.188
The Intelligence Committee

00:01:45.188 --> 00:01:46.064
was very much aware

00:01:46.064 --> 00:01:47.023
that the conflict

00:01:47.023 --> 00:01:47.941
between Prigozhin

00:01:47.941 --> 00:01:50.610
and Putin was inevitable.

00:01:50.652 --> 00:01:51.820
This is not a weekend trip

00:01:51.820 --> 00:01:52.570
he's taking,

00:01:52.570 --> 00:01:53.863
taking his convoy

00:01:53.863 --> 00:01:56.366
and his military convoy up to Moscow.

00:01:56.533 --> 00:01:57.909
There's a number of accomplices,

00:01:57.909 --> 00:01:58.868
including, as we saw,

00:01:58.868 --> 00:02:00.787
some of the Russian people on the border

00:02:00.787 --> 00:02:01.329
with Ukraine

00:02:01.329 --> 00:02:03.540
who clearly support the group

00:02:03.540 --> 00:02:05.375
in contrast to their support

00:02:05.375 --> 00:02:06.876
for the Russian government.

00:02:06.876 --> 00:02:07.919
This is something that would have had

00:02:07.919 --> 00:02:08.586
to have been planned

00:02:08.586 --> 00:02:09.796
for a significant amount of time

00:02:09.796 --> 00:02:11.005
to be executed in the manner

00:02:11.005 --> 00:02:12.006
which it was.

00:02:12.715 --> 00:02:13.299
So that was Mike

00:02:13.299 --> 00:02:14.509
Turner, the Republican head of the House

00:02:14.509 --> 00:02:15.552
Intelligence Committee,

00:02:15.552 --> 00:02:18.388
indicating that this was very much known

00:02:18.388 --> 00:02:20.265
by the intelligence community.

00:02:20.265 --> 00:02:22.392
Jim, what was not

00:02:22.392 --> 00:02:24.519
expected was the lack of resistance

00:02:24.519 --> 00:02:26.062
to these Wagner forces.

00:02:26.062 --> 00:02:26.855
I'm told the U.S.

00:02:26.855 --> 00:02:27.856
assessment

00:02:27.856 --> 00:02:28.565
thought that there would be

00:02:28.565 --> 00:02:30.817
a lot more violence, a lot more bloodshed

00:02:30.817 --> 00:02:33.736
as Wagner tried to get head north

00:02:33.736 --> 00:02:35.196
and get to the Russian capital.

00:02:35.196 --> 00:02:35.655
All right.

00:02:35.655 --> 00:02:36.447
Alex Marquardt,

00:02:36.447 --> 00:02:38.158
thank you very much for that.

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:38.950
At this hour,

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:40.034
we still do not know where

00:02:40.034 --> 00:02:41.536
Vladimir Putin is.

00:02:41.536 --> 00:02:43.413
Ukrainian President Zelensky said

00:02:43.413 --> 00:02:43.872
yesterday

00:02:43.872 --> 00:02:44.622
the Russian leader

00:02:44.622 --> 00:02:44.998
is, quote,

00:02:44.998 --> 00:02:47.834
very afraid and was no longer in Moscow.

00:02:48.334 --> 00:02:50.378
With me now is Yuri Soviet's.

00:02:50.962 --> 00:02:52.046
He studied with Putin

00:02:52.046 --> 00:02:53.882
at the KGB Institute

00:02:53.882 --> 00:02:56.176
and worked as a Soviet spy in Washington.

00:02:56.926 --> 00:02:57.635
Yuri,

00:02:57.635 --> 00:02:58.845
thank you very much

00:02:58.845 --> 00:02:59.888
for joining us tonight.

00:02:59.888 --> 00:03:01.514
I can't imagine

00:03:01.514 --> 00:03:02.557
there are a whole lot of folks out there

00:03:02.557 --> 00:03:03.766
who might have better insights

00:03:03.766 --> 00:03:04.976
into what has occurred

00:03:04.976 --> 00:03:06.311
this past weekend than you do.

00:03:07.353 --> 00:03:08.438
What do you think?

00:03:08.438 --> 00:03:08.646
How do

00:03:08.646 --> 00:03:09.397
you think Putin

00:03:09.397 --> 00:03:10.273
is reacting

00:03:10.273 --> 00:03:12.525
to reacting to this near insurrection

00:03:12.525 --> 00:03:14.235
and at the same time?

00:03:14.235 --> 00:03:15.278
Why isn't we?

00:03:15.278 --> 00:03:17.614
Why is it that we have not seen Putin

00:03:17.614 --> 00:03:19.490
since that angry statement

00:03:19.490 --> 00:03:22.410
that he put out just about 24 hours ago?

00:03:24.954 --> 00:03:27.165
Thank you for having me, Jim.

00:03:27.165 --> 00:03:28.041
First.

00:03:28.583 --> 00:03:30.877
I believe this is a disaster for Putin.

00:03:31.002 --> 00:03:32.503
And he understands

00:03:32.503 --> 00:03:34.839
he realizes this is a disaster.

00:03:34.839 --> 00:03:36.758
And according to his practices

00:03:36.758 --> 00:03:40.053
in similar situation, he digs into a hole

00:03:40.053 --> 00:03:42.430
and stays there as long as possible.

00:03:42.430 --> 00:03:44.641
This is what he is doing right now.

00:03:44.641 --> 00:03:45.642
And

00:03:46.935 --> 00:03:48.519
the last two days,

00:03:48.519 --> 00:03:52.607
it was the final act of defeat of Putin.

00:03:52.815 --> 00:03:55.568
Putin's image, which has been building

00:03:55.860 --> 00:03:58.780
since the year 2000,

00:03:58.780 --> 00:04:00.740
since the beginning of the aggression

00:04:00.740 --> 00:04:01.658
into Ukraine.

00:04:02.951 --> 00:04:04.994
He destroyed a reputation or

00:04:04.994 --> 00:04:05.578
a myth

00:04:05.578 --> 00:04:07.121
about the Russian army

00:04:07.121 --> 00:04:09.791
being the second best in the world.

00:04:10.083 --> 00:04:12.335
Now, this is the second army

00:04:13.127 --> 00:04:16.089
in Russia after Wagner, apparently.

00:04:16.547 --> 00:04:19.259
And over the last two

00:04:19.259 --> 00:04:22.303
days, he showed that

00:04:22.303 --> 00:04:24.639
his grip on power in

00:04:24.639 --> 00:04:27.725
Russia is almost nonexistent.

00:04:28.601 --> 00:04:30.770
He balances over the last 20 years,

00:04:30.770 --> 00:04:32.897
his act was to balance

00:04:32.897 --> 00:04:34.983
between different factions. He doesn't.

00:04:35.775 --> 00:04:36.734
He doesn't do.

00:04:36.734 --> 00:04:39.070
He is not in position to do it anymore.

00:04:39.070 --> 00:04:42.031
He controls the country as a Mafia style

00:04:42.073 --> 00:04:44.993
organization, and

00:04:46.035 --> 00:04:46.869
she loves control.

00:04:46.869 --> 00:04:48.329
This question is

00:04:48.705 --> 00:04:49.914
how humiliating is it

00:04:49.914 --> 00:04:50.290
for Putin

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:50.915
to be challenged

00:04:50.915 --> 00:04:52.417
by someone like Prigozhin

00:04:52.417 --> 00:04:55.253
that to essentially have forgotten

00:04:55.545 --> 00:04:59.007
125 miles or so from Moscow,

00:04:59.007 --> 00:05:02.176
somebody who was once his protege

00:05:02.927 --> 00:05:04.262
Exactly. Exactly.

00:05:04.262 --> 00:05:05.722
Because the

00:05:05.722 --> 00:05:07.140
precautions especially

00:05:07.140 --> 00:05:09.434
especially the betrayal of Prigozhin.

00:05:09.434 --> 00:05:11.769
Because for Putin, it was a lap dog.

00:05:12.353 --> 00:05:15.189
Prigozhin as a personality was created

00:05:15.189 --> 00:05:17.442
by Putin essentially before.

00:05:18.067 --> 00:05:19.485
Before they met

00:05:19.485 --> 00:05:22.905
Prigozhin was a two time hardcore drug

00:05:24.282 --> 00:05:25.033
criminal.

00:05:25.033 --> 00:05:26.701
Hardcore criminal.

00:05:26.701 --> 00:05:29.495
And this is Putin who made him very rich,

00:05:30.163 --> 00:05:32.248
famous and powerful.

00:05:32.248 --> 00:05:36.461
So Putin can see this as a real betrayal.

00:05:36.961 --> 00:05:39.005
And if he is to say it in the past,

00:05:39.005 --> 00:05:40.506
there is one crime

00:05:40.506 --> 00:05:42.300
which he cannot pardon.

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:43.718
And this is a betrayal.

00:05:43.718 --> 00:05:45.803
But this is what he did yesterday.

00:05:45.803 --> 00:05:48.264
You know, just that he does it well.

00:05:48.264 --> 00:05:48.765
Yeah.

00:05:48.765 --> 00:05:49.807
What do you make of this deal

00:05:49.807 --> 00:05:50.433
that they made?

00:05:50.433 --> 00:05:53.144
They they made this deal where

00:05:53.144 --> 00:05:55.229
Prigozhin gets to leave for Belarus

00:05:55.229 --> 00:05:56.773
and his mercenaries

00:05:56.773 --> 00:05:57.398
and Wagner

00:05:57.398 --> 00:05:59.692
are folded into the Russian military

00:05:59.692 --> 00:06:01.778
and that that is that all is forgiven.

00:06:01.903 --> 00:06:03.821
Can you believe that?

00:06:04.947 --> 00:06:06.699
Well, this is what not just so.

00:06:06.699 --> 00:06:08.159
I cannot believe what I have.

00:06:08.159 --> 00:06:09.285
Difficult to believe,

00:06:09.285 --> 00:06:11.120
but most Russians hardly

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:11.871
clearly believe

00:06:11.871 --> 00:06:12.747
because it's

00:06:12.747 --> 00:06:15.291
there is a clear humiliation,

00:06:15.291 --> 00:06:18.461
more and even more so, because what

00:06:18.461 --> 00:06:19.295
we know so far is

00:06:19.295 --> 00:06:20.671
this is an official part

00:06:20.671 --> 00:06:21.672
of the arrangement.

00:06:21.672 --> 00:06:24.550
But sources close to Kremlin,

00:06:24.675 --> 00:06:28.179
they say that there is one very important

00:06:29.180 --> 00:06:29.889
point of

00:06:29.889 --> 00:06:31.140
the real arrangement,

00:06:31.140 --> 00:06:33.893
which is not yet has not been announced.

00:06:33.893 --> 00:06:38.022
And this is Shoigu, the defense minister

00:06:38.272 --> 00:06:40.358
and the chief of staff

00:06:41.025 --> 00:06:43.111
will go into retirement.

00:06:43.111 --> 00:06:45.279
There will not be fires in disgrace

00:06:45.905 --> 00:06:48.741
as a precaution demanded, but

00:06:48.741 --> 00:06:50.576
they will be moving to retirement

00:06:50.576 --> 00:06:53.704
that it was a single, explicitly

00:06:53.704 --> 00:06:56.290
formulated demand of precaution.

00:06:57.291 --> 00:07:00.336
And let me ask you this.

00:07:00.336 --> 00:07:02.380
How is Putin

00:07:02.380 --> 00:07:05.341
going to survive this politically?

00:07:05.341 --> 00:07:06.342
We were talking about this

00:07:06.342 --> 00:07:07.844
with other guests during this program

00:07:07.844 --> 00:07:08.344
that I know

00:07:08.344 --> 00:07:09.512
from Russian

00:07:09.512 --> 00:07:10.596
history is the history

00:07:10.596 --> 00:07:11.848
of the Soviet Union.

00:07:11.848 --> 00:07:13.724
Generational change in Russia,

00:07:13.724 --> 00:07:14.809
where the Soviet Union, for that

00:07:14.809 --> 00:07:15.518
matter, can happen

00:07:15.518 --> 00:07:16.310
very quickly,

00:07:16.310 --> 00:07:17.103
very suddenly,

00:07:17.103 --> 00:07:19.439
and take the world by surprise.

00:07:19.439 --> 00:07:20.022
Do you

00:07:20.022 --> 00:07:21.232
do you think something like

00:07:21.232 --> 00:07:22.358
that could happen

00:07:22.358 --> 00:07:24.152
and bring about the end of Vladimir Putin

00:07:27.029 --> 00:07:27.947
It's hard to say

00:07:27.947 --> 00:07:30.950
because Putin's personnel policy over

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:34.704
the 20 years in power was to nominate

00:07:35.121 --> 00:07:35.830
among

00:07:36.038 --> 00:07:37.165
