00:07:37.165 --> 00:07:39.709
people who are not intelligent,

00:07:40.126 --> 00:07:42.420
not they have no guts there.

00:07:42.420 --> 00:07:44.839
Most of them have no entities, let's say

00:07:45.465 --> 00:07:46.716
So there is like,

00:07:46.716 --> 00:07:47.341
you know,

00:07:47.341 --> 00:07:49.385
like Gray my my assistants,

00:07:49.385 --> 00:07:50.553
he used to say.

00:07:50.553 --> 00:07:54.015
So it's hard to imagine that these people

00:07:54.056 --> 00:07:56.601
can commit a coup d'état.

00:07:56.601 --> 00:07:59.437
Prigozhin two times convicted criminal

00:07:59.896 --> 00:08:01.063
Putin's chef.

00:08:01.063 --> 00:08:02.565
He dared to do this

00:08:02.565 --> 00:08:04.901
by the high ranking military FSB

00:08:04.984 --> 00:08:06.777
They they they did it there.

00:08:06.777 --> 00:08:07.904
So the country is right

00:08:07.904 --> 00:08:10.364
now is basically in a freefall.

00:08:10.948 --> 00:08:11.991
I mean, in terms

00:08:11.991 --> 00:08:15.536
that the system of control

00:08:15.995 --> 00:08:18.706
and governance is almost destroyed.

00:08:19.165 --> 00:08:19.957
I don't know how

00:08:19.957 --> 00:08:21.125
they are going to repair this.

00:08:21.125 --> 00:08:23.169
But what is important to understand

00:08:23.169 --> 00:08:26.047
in similar circumstance Putin's threat

00:08:26.088 --> 00:08:28.925
tactic is to fight back with threats

00:08:29.592 --> 00:08:30.051
bluff.

00:08:30.051 --> 00:08:31.093
Most of them

00:08:31.093 --> 00:08:32.303
also stress

00:08:32.303 --> 00:08:33.763
bluffing, such as,

