has caused on the front lines.

00:09:49.255 --> 00:09:49.839
Many argue

00:09:49.839 --> 00:09:50.590
the vulnerable

00:09:50.590 --> 00:09:51.674
not necessarily

00:09:51.674 --> 00:09:53.384
involved in front line fighting.

00:09:53.384 --> 00:09:54.552
Certainly those units

00:09:54.552 --> 00:09:54.927
that made

00:09:54.927 --> 00:09:56.721
that move were adequately prepared

00:09:56.721 --> 00:09:56.971
and have

00:09:56.971 --> 00:09:58.973
been away from the front for some time.

00:09:59.181 --> 00:10:01.475
But what has this done to morale?

00:10:01.517 --> 00:10:02.768
Certainly Ukraine is saying

00:10:02.768 --> 00:10:03.894
they've managed

00:10:03.894 --> 00:10:05.980
relatively obtuse by what they say here

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:07.732
to move forward one or two kilometers

00:10:07.732 --> 00:10:09.191
on the outskirts of Baquba.

00:10:09.191 --> 00:10:09.859
And today, they,

00:10:09.859 --> 00:10:11.944
without any real specifics, suggests

00:10:11.944 --> 00:10:13.321
that it had some progress

00:10:13.321 --> 00:10:14.739
in the rear direction.

00:10:14.739 --> 00:10:15.364
That's essentially

00:10:15.364 --> 00:10:17.533
an Zakariya where many believe

00:10:17.533 --> 00:10:18.492
and that southern area,

00:10:18.492 --> 00:10:20.036
Ukraine wants to make a breakthrough

00:10:20.036 --> 00:10:21.871
to the Crimean peninsula

00:10:21.871 --> 00:10:24.248
occupied by Russia, off from Donbas

00:10:24.290 --> 00:10:25.958
and the Russian mainland proper.

00:10:25.958 --> 00:10:28.002
So suggestions that we might be seeing

00:10:28.252 --> 00:10:29.837
some kind of progress,

00:10:29.837 --> 00:10:31.964
but it's very hard to get specifics.

00:10:31.964 --> 00:10:33.090
And I think to

00:10:33.090 --> 00:10:34.800
a probably a sense of cautious

00:10:34.800 --> 00:10:37.011
timing here among Ukrainian

00:10:37.011 --> 00:10:37.678
military,

00:10:37.678 --> 00:10:38.679
they don't want to move

00:10:38.679 --> 00:10:40.264
necessarily too fast

00:10:40.264 --> 00:10:41.724
without being fully apprized of

00:10:41.724 --> 00:10:43.476
exactly how things have changed

00:10:43.476 --> 00:10:44.435
along the front line.

00:10:44.435 --> 00:10:45.603
But they certainly don't want to wait

00:10:45.603 --> 00:10:47.855
so long for the chaos subside in Moscow

00:10:47.980 --> 00:10:49.482
that that moment is indeed past

00:10:49.482 --> 00:10:51.067
so utterly vital

00:10:51.067 --> 00:10:52.151
that Kiev seizes this

00:10:52.151 --> 00:10:53.444
moment for its benefit Jim.

